## Title: Custom Queue Sounds (Console)
## APIVersion: 101048 101049 101050
## AddOnVersion: 1
## Version: 1.0.0
## Author: Vixen Hunny
## Description: Keeps playing an alert sound while a dungeon, battleground or Cyrodiil queue pop is up, until you accept or decline. Pick the sound and how often it repeats in Settings > Addons.
